    "slug": "storefront-copywriting-bios-product-descriptions-serp-ctr",
    "title": "Anti-Slop Copywriting for Online Sellers: How to Format Bios, Product Descriptions, and Google SERP Snippets That Actually Convert",
    "category": "Growth & SEO",
    "date": "November 15, 2026",
    "readTime": "8 min read",
